== character mira
name: Mira
pronouns: she
image: mira
lives at: shelter
values:
    trust: wary, friendly, close
    asked_about_town: flag
talk:
    Mira looks up from the map she is drawing and gives you a tired smile.
    -> mira.talk

== quest supplies
name: Supplies for the shelter
region: old_town
stages:
    not_started
    asked: Mira asked you to find food for the shelter.
    delivered: You brought Mira a can of beans.
done at: delivered

== menu mira.talk
title: What do you want to talk about?
leave: Nevermind
pause after each: yes
leave text: You let Mira get back to her map.

* The town -- Ask what happened here
    -> mira.about_town
* Supplies -- Ask if the shelter needs anything [if quest supplies is not_started]
    Mira sighs. 'Food, mostly. If you find anything sealed, bring it here.'
    ~ quest supplies = asked
* Give the beans -- Hand over the can of beans [if quest supplies is asked and player has can_of_beans]
    ~ take can_of_beans
    ~ quest supplies = delivered
    ~ mira.trust = friendly
    'You actually found some!' Mira hugs the can like treasure. [mira_thanks]
* Just sit with her -- Spend a while in quiet company [if mira.trust is at least friendly] [then leave]
    You sit together without talking. It is the calmest you have felt in days.
    ~ spend 1 turn

== scene mira.about_town
if not mira.asked_about_town:
    'It went quiet in a single night,' Mira says. 'Power, phones, everything.'
    ~ mira.asked_about_town = yes quietly
else:
    Mira shrugs. 'I told you what I know. [one of]Which isn't much.[or]Someone in the market might know more.[at random]'

== text mira_thanks
[one of]She can't stop smiling.[or]For a moment she looks years younger.[stopping]
